# 🚢 Titanic Survival Prediction

## 📌 Problem Statement

The goal of this project is to analyze passenger data and identify factors that influenced survival on the Titanic, and build a model to predict survival.

## 📊 Dataset

Titanic dataset containing features like age, gender, class, and fare.

## 🛠️ Tools

Python, Pandas, Matplotlib, Scikit-learn

## 🔍 Process

* Data cleaning
* Exploratory data analysis
* Model building

## 📈 Key Insights

* Females had higher survival rates
* First-class passengers survived more
* Age influenced survival

## 📌 Conclusion

Data analysis helps uncover patterns and build predictive models for real-world problems.

